column95:
Hah, mostly: delete, delete, delete.<p><a href="http://www.screenr.com/xd0" rel="nofollow">http://www.screenr.com/xd0</a><p>Fair warning, the syntax in that screencast is a bit out of date.<p>For your codebase, instead of having to "call super" manually:<p><pre><code>    orbium.Inspector = function(count, xnr, ynr, vari, col) {

      this.setBase = function() {
        orbium.Tile.prototype.setBase.call(this, "modtile");
      };

    }
</code></pre>
It'll look more like:<p><pre><code>    class orbium.Inspector extends orbium.Tile 

      constructor: (count, xnr, ynr, vari, col) ->
        ...

      setBase: ->
        super "modtile"</code></pre>
